<title>POLAND: Poland raises 52-week T-bill offer to PLN 600 mln.</title>
<headline>Poland raises 52-week T-bill offer to PLN 600 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry said it raised the offer of its 52-week T-bills for the tender next Monday by 100 million zlotys to 600 million zlotys.</p>
<p>The ministry will also offer 200 million zlotys worth of 8-week bills, 300 million zlotys of 13-week bills and 200 million zlotys worth of the 26-week paper.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
